   "ref": "Sambandar puranam (PP no. 28), verse 66",
   "first_words_ta": "அழுகின்ற பிள்ளையார் தமைநோக்கி அருட்கருணை",
   "gist": "The Lord on the Tirutoni hill sees the crying child, looks at Uma and bids her feed him milk in a golden bowl.",
