   "gist": "At Madurai the king's right-side fever: Sambandar takes holy ash and smears the Pandya, who is cured; the Jains are routed.",
   "url": "https://thevaaram.org/thirumurai_1/onepage.php?thiru=12&Song_idField=12280",
   "confirmed": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Periya Puranam (Sekkizhar, Tirumurai 12)",
   "ref": "Sambandar puranam (PP no. 28), verse 765",
   "first_words_ta": "திருவளர் நீறு கொண்டு திருக்கையால்",
   "gist": "Smeared with holy ash by Sambandar's hand, the king's fever leaves and he cools like one bathing in a pond.",
   "url": "https://thevaaram.org/thirumurai_1/onepage.php?thiru=12&Song_idField=12280",
   "confirmed": true
  },
  {
