   "gist": "The king's hunch is straightened as the leaf floats upstream.",
   "url": "https://thevaaram.org/thirumurai_1/onepage.php?thiru=12&Song_idField=12280",
   "confirmed": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Periya Puranam (Sekkizhar, Tirumurai 12)",
   "ref": "Sambandar puranam (PP no. 28), verse 850",
   "first_words_ta": "ஏடகம் பிள்ளை யார்தாம் வன்னிஎன்",
   "gist": "Sambandar sings the Tiruvedagam verse; the leaf halts at Edagam and Kulachchirai retrieves it.",
